Summons your lust for blood and destruction; especially when the odds are against you.

You increase your damage by 10% + [1.0%, 2.3%, 3.9%, 5.0%, 6.0% (CON 10-100)] per enemy you can see in line of sight of you (maximum 5 enemies, [15%, 22%, 29%, 35%, 40% (CON 10-100)] bonus) for 3 turns.

The damage bonus will increase with your Constitution.
